1088
01:05:31,450 --> 01:05:33,470
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Tapi Ross bukan pria itu lagi.</font></font></font></font>

1089
01:05:33,490 --> 01:05:35,560
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Tak ada dari kita yang harus
terikat oleh masa lalu kita.</font></font></font></font>

1090
01:05:35,580 --> 01:05:38,490
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Cap, orangku butuh 24 jam
untuk pil itu.</font></font></font></font>

1091
01:05:38,520 --> 01:05:39,580
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Oke. Kita perlu ke DC</font></font></font></font>

1092
01:05:39,600 --> 01:05:41,560
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">dan beri tahu Ross
apa yang direncanakan Sterns.</font></font></font></font>

1093
01:05:41,580 --> 01:05:42,660
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Presiden Ross tak ada di DC.</font></font></font></font>

1094
01:05:43,550 --> 01:05:44,670
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Dia ada di USS Milius.</font></font></font></font>

1095
01:05:45,440 --> 01:05:46,630
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Mereka baru saja pindah
ke Samudera Hindia.</font></font></font></font>

1096
01:05:46,650 --> 01:05:48,640
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Kapal perang Jepang juga
berada di dekatnya.</font></font></font></font>

1097
01:05:48,660 --> 01:05:51,480
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Sial. Bersiaplah.
Kita harus bergerak.</font></font></font></font>

1098
01:05:58,450 --> 01:05:59,450
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Ada yang bisa kubantu?</font></font></font></font>

1099
01:05:59,470 --> 01:06:00,520
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Halo, Laksamana.</font></font></font></font>

1100
01:06:00,540 --> 01:06:02,470
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Boleh saya pakai telepon Anda?</font></font></font></font>

1101
01:06:02,490 --> 01:06:04,450
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Hei, sayang.
Siapa yang di pintu?</font></font></font></font>

1102
01:06:09,440 --> 01:06:10,500
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Sialan.</font></font></font></font>

1103
01:06:10,530 --> 01:06:11,670
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Pernah lihat sesuatu seperti ini?</font></font></font></font>

1104
01:06:12,440 --> 01:06:13,500
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Tidak, belum pernah.</font></font></font></font>

1105
01:06:14,000 --> 01:06:17,010
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14"><b>Pulau Celestial</b></font></font></font></font>

1106
01:06:40,520 --> 01:06:42,480
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Biarkan aku yang bicara
atau dia tak akan pernah mendengarkan.</font></font></font></font>

1107
01:06:42,500 --> 01:06:44,550
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Aku belum pernah melihat Ross seperti ini
sejak di tentara.</font></font></font></font>

1108
01:06:44,570 --> 01:06:45,590
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Dia sebaiknya cepat sadar.</font></font></font></font>

1109
01:06:45,610 --> 01:06:48,600
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Karena apapun yang direncanakan Sterns,
itu akan segera terjadi.</font></font></font></font>

1110
01:06:50,530 --> 01:06:52,640
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Aku ingin <i>armada F-18</i>
siap untuk meluncur.</font></font></font></font>

1111
01:06:52,660 --> 01:06:55,440
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Jika mereka memutar kapal itu,
aku ingin...</font></font></font></font>

1112
01:06:56,620 --> 01:06:58,440
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Apa yang dia lakukan di sini?</font></font></font></font>

1113
01:06:58,460 --> 01:07:00,440
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Sudah kubilang jangan
terlibat, Wilson.</font></font></font></font>

1114
01:07:00,460 --> 01:07:01,520
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Saya yang membawanya, Pak.</font></font></font></font>

1115
01:07:01,540 --> 01:07:02,540
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Aku ingin dia keluar dari sini!</font></font></font></font>

1116
01:07:02,560 --> 01:07:04,590
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Pak, Anda memintaku
untuk menjalankan investigasi ini,</font></font></font></font>

1117
01:07:04,610 --> 01:07:07,590
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">- dan situasinya—
- Jangan repot-repot dengan alasan.</font></font></font></font>

1118
01:07:07,610 --> 01:07:10,450
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Anda punya tugas sederhana
dan Anda gagal.</font></font></font></font>

1119
01:07:10,470 --> 01:07:11,470
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Tn. Presiden,</font></font></font></font>

1120
01:07:12,490 --> 01:07:14,600
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">kami telah menemukan intel
di Camp Echo One</font></font></font></font>

1121
01:07:14,620 --> 01:07:17,500
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">yang bisa membahayakan jutaan nyawa.</font></font></font></font>

1122
01:07:17,530 --> 01:07:19,540
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Sekarang, Anda dan saya sama-sama tahu
Isaiah tidak bersalah.</font></font></font></font>

1123
01:07:20,610 --> 01:07:23,480
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Saya senang melakukan
percakapan ini di depan umum,</font></font></font></font>

1124
01:07:23,500 --> 01:07:24,500
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">jika Anda mau.</font></font></font></font>

1125
01:07:31,630 --> 01:07:34,480
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Ini gila.
Jepang seharusnya menjadi—</font></font></font></font>

1126
01:07:34,500 --> 01:07:36,550
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Jackal?</font></font></font></font>

1127
01:07:36,570 --> 01:07:37,620
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Jackal, apakah kau mendengar?</font></font></font></font>

1128
01:07:43,550 --> 01:07:44,650
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Cepat, Wilson.</font></font></font></font>

1129
01:07:46,590 --> 01:07:48,580
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Aku dikejar armada Jepang</font></font></font></font>

1130
01:07:48,600 --> 01:07:50,580
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">berusaha mencapai
pulau itu sebelum kita.</font></font></font></font>

1131
01:07:50,600 --> 01:07:52,440
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Itu persis yang dia inginkan.</font></font></font></font>

1132
01:07:52,460 --> 01:07:55,440
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Sterns telah mengendalikan
semua orang di balik segalanya.</font></font></font></font>

1133
01:07:55,460 --> 01:07:56,670
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Pencurian adamantium
oleh SERPENT,</font></font></font></font>

1134
01:07:57,440 --> 01:07:58,570
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">serangan ke Gedung Putih.</font></font></font></font>

1135
01:07:58,590 --> 01:08:00,520
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Kebocoran CIA ke Jepang.</font></font></font></font>

1136
01:08:01,500 --> 01:08:03,530
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Dia mengadu domba Anda dan Jepang</font></font></font></font>

1137
01:08:03,550 --> 01:08:05,530
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">untuk memastikan momen ini terjadi.</font></font></font></font>

1138
01:08:05,550 --> 01:08:07,580
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Bagaimana dia bisa melakukan
semua itu dari penjara?</font></font></font></font>

1139
01:08:07,600 --> 01:08:10,610
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14"><i>Kontrol pikiran.</i>
Dia menciptakan teknologi</font></font></font></font>

1140
01:08:10,630 --> 01:08:12,520
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">yang memungkinkannya
mengontrol pikiran</font></font></font></font>

1141
01:08:12,540 --> 01:08:13,650
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">siapa pun yang dia targetkan.</font></font></font></font>

1142
01:08:14,490 --> 01:08:15,640
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Termasuk mungkin Anda, Pak.</font></font></font></font>

1143
01:08:21,590 --> 01:08:23,640
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Apakah Anda merasa
seperti diri sendiri akhir-akhir ini?</font></font></font></font>

1144
01:08:30,490 --> 01:08:31,620
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Tentu saja.</font></font></font></font>

1145
01:08:31,640 --> 01:08:33,630
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Tapi dia punya
data Anda, Pak. Mengapa?</font></font></font></font>

1146
01:08:33,650 --> 01:08:34,660
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Aku tak tahu.</font></font></font></font>

1147
01:08:35,600 --> 01:08:39,480
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Jika dia bisa mengontrol pikiran,
tentu dia bisa meretas berkas.</font></font></font></font>

1148
01:08:39,500 --> 01:08:42,520
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Log menunjukkan Anda mengunjungi
Camp Echo One berkali-kali.</font></font></font></font>

1149
01:08:42,540 --> 01:08:46,650
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Untuk memastikan tahanan
bernilai tinggi aman.</font></font></font></font>

1150
01:08:46,670 --> 01:08:48,490
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Ya, tapi pemindaian, EKG,</font></font></font></font>

1151
01:08:48,520 --> 01:08:50,470
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">semua tes darah dilakukan
di sana, Pak.</font></font></font></font>

1152
01:08:50,490 --> 01:08:51,500
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Ini konyol.</font></font></font></font>

1153
01:08:51,530 --> 01:08:53,440
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Tn. Presiden,
jawab pertanyaannya.</font></font></font></font>

1154
01:08:53,460 --> 01:08:55,480
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Aku tak harus menjawabmu!</font></font></font></font>

1155
01:08:55,500 --> 01:08:56,540
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Mengapa mengunjungi Black Site,</font></font></font></font>

1156
01:08:56,560 --> 01:08:58,490
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">- di tengah antah berantah...
- Wilson, berhenti!</font></font></font></font>

1157
01:08:58,520 --> 01:08:59,570
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Aku perintahkan kau untuk berhenti!</font></font></font></font>

1158
01:08:59,590 --> 01:09:01,470
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">- ...untuk melakukan tes ini?
- Aku perintahkan kau untuk berhenti!</font></font></font></font>

1159
01:09:01,490 --> 01:09:03,560
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">- Mengapa?
- Karena aku sekarat,</font></font></font></font>

1160
01:09:03,580 --> 01:09:04,620
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">sialan!</font></font></font></font>

1161
01:09:09,470 --> 01:09:11,680
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Karena jantungku gagal!</font></font></font></font>

1162
01:09:13,650 --> 01:09:16,460
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Tak ada yang bisa mengetahuinya
sampai dia melakukannya.</font></font></font></font>

1163
01:09:20,660 --> 01:09:24,470
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Hal-hal ini
membuatku tetap hidup.</font></font></font></font>

1164
01:09:25,530 --> 01:09:28,470
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Dan sebagai balasannya,
aku memberinya harapan</font></font></font></font>

1165
01:09:28,490 --> 01:09:30,460
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">bahwa dia mungkin bisa
mendapatkan hidupnya kembali.</font></font></font></font>

1166
01:09:31,520 --> 01:09:34,580
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Dia mendapatkan lab
untuk melakukan pekerjaan itu.</font></font></font></font>

1167
01:09:35,540 --> 01:09:37,550
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Aku bahkan mencoba
untuk memindahkannya tapi—</font></font></font></font>

1168
01:09:37,570 --> 01:09:39,490
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Tapi kau tak bisa mengambil risiko
kehilangan pil itu.</font></font></font></font>

1169
01:09:45,470 --> 01:09:47,660
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Setelah temanmu Hulk
dan Abomination</font></font></font></font>

1170
01:09:47,680 --> 01:09:51,650
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">menghancurkan Harlem,
seseorang harus menanggung akibatnya.</font></font></font></font>

1171
01:09:52,540 --> 01:09:53,600
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Sterns hanya...</font></font></font></font>

1172
01:09:54,590 --> 01:09:56,530
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">kerusakan tambahan.</font></font></font></font>

1173
01:09:59,670 --> 01:10:02,540
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Aku telah mendedikasikan
seluruh hidupku</font></font></font></font>

1174
01:10:03,520 --> 01:10:05,470
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">untuk melayani negara ini.</font></font></font></font>

1175
01:10:09,470 --> 01:10:11,470
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Satu-satunya orang yang penting...</font></font></font></font>

1176
01:10:12,600 --> 01:10:14,650
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">tampaknya tak mengerti.</font></font></font></font>

1177
01:10:15,670 --> 01:10:22,540
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Betty tak pernah memaafkanku karena
mengirim tentara untuk mengejar Banner.</font></font></font></font>

1178
01:10:25,460 --> 01:10:27,450
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Aku harus bertahan...</font></font></font></font>

1179
01:10:31,670 --> 01:10:34,550
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">...agar putriku tahu</font></font></font></font>

1180
01:10:34,570 --> 01:10:36,660
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">bahwa ada lebih banyak
tentang ayahnya.</font></font></font></font>

1181
01:10:37,680 --> 01:10:39,670
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Bahwa aku adalah pria yang sama
yang dulu membawanya</font></font></font></font>

1182
01:10:40,440 --> 01:10:41,610
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">untuk melihat bunga sakura.</font></font></font></font>

1183
01:10:43,580 --> 01:10:45,550
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Dia masih bisa, Pak.</font></font></font></font>

1184
01:10:47,670 --> 01:10:49,560
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Aku tahu bagaimana rasanya...</font></font></font></font>

1185
01:10:51,650 --> 01:10:54,440
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">merasa kau memiliki
sesuatu untuk dibuktikan.</font></font></font></font>

1186
01:10:55,580 --> 01:10:57,590
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Semua orang hanya melihat satu hal.</font></font></font></font>

1187
01:10:59,550 --> 01:11:01,590
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Tapi ketika menunjukkan
ada lebih banyak tentangmu,</font></font></font></font>

1188
01:11:02,550 --> 01:11:04,600
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">itu bukan tentang
ketika masa-masa mudah.</font></font></font></font>

1189
01:11:05,540 --> 01:11:07,680
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Ini tentang momen seperti ini.</font></font></font></font>

1190
01:11:10,460 --> 01:11:13,460
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Sekarang, kita di sini
karena Sterns ingin balas dendam</font></font></font></font>

1191
01:11:13,480 --> 01:11:15,570
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">dan tak peduli
jika dia memicu perang.</font></font></font></font>

1192
01:11:15,590 --> 01:11:17,660
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Kita bermain tepat ke tangannya.</font></font></font></font>

1193
01:11:18,550 --> 01:11:20,550
<font color="#dede02"><font color="#24f109"><font color="#2cec13"><font color="#07ca14">Pak Presiden, dua F-18 kita</font></font></font></font>

1194
01:11:20,570 --> 01:11:22,630
